          "text": "\u2026hing spectacular, but good. THE MEAT 'N 3: Today's meat selection was chicken fried chicken and it was spot on. Served with Southern Greens, Mac and 3 Cheeses, and something I don't recall. The mac and cheese was strong with gruyere and nee\u2026",
